<title>USA: Dynamics Corp Q4 shr $0.72 vs $0.42.</title>
<headline>Dynamics Corp Q4 shr $0.72 vs $0.42.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, CT 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>DYNAMICS CORPORATION OF AMERICA</p>
<p>			  THREE MONTHS		TWELVE MONTHS</p>
<p>		     ENDED DECEMBER 31,	ENDED DECEMBER 31,</p>
<p>			  1996	 1995	   1996	  1995</p>
<p>			    (reclassified)	     (reclassified)</p>
<p>NET SALES    $33,008,000 $29,220,000 $129,206,000 $114,164,000</p>
<p> NET INCOME    2,753,000   1,611,000   10,607,000   6,723,000</p>
<p>INCOME PER</p>
<p>  COMMON SHARE:     0.72	  0.42	   2.78	  1.75</p>
<p> AVG SHRS	3,816,641   3,834,774    3,820,302   3,839,488</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 includes a gain of $0.08 a share from reclassification of provision for Fermont disposition.</p>
<p>Full-year results include gains from reclassification of Fermont disposition of $0.07 a share in 1996 and $0.25 a share in 1995.</p>
<p>Results include income from equity investment in CTS Corp. Q4 income from equity investment in CTS was $2.38 million vs $1.33 million. Full-year income from equity investment in CTS was $10.28 million vs $4.41 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk  212-859-1610))</p>
